[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=0.5cm,y=0.2cm]
\draw[gray!30,very thin,xstep=1,ystep=5] (0,0) grid (8,25);
\draw[->] (0,0)--(0,28);
\draw[->] (0,0)--(9,0);
\foreach \y in {5,10,15,20,25} {\node[left,font=\scriptsize] at (0,\y) {$\y$};}
\node[below left,font=\scriptsize] at (0,0) {$0$};
\foreach \x in {2,4,6,8} {\node[below,font=\scriptsize] at (\x,0) {$\x$};}
\draw[very thick,blue] (0,0)--(4,25)--(8,25);
\node[rotate=90,font=\scriptsize] at (-1.5,12.5) {Speed (m/s)};
\node[below,font=\scriptsize] at (4,-2.5) {Time (s)};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
An aircraft accelerates from rest to $25$ m/s over $4$ seconds, then cruises at $25$ m/s for a further $4$ seconds, as shown.
Find the total distance travelled, in m.

